1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,076
A booking that doesn't match the request is a support ticket.

2
00:00:05,492 --> 00:00:12,825
This proof of concept uses a synthetic two-tenant corpus. The method applies to your call flow.

3
00:00:13,477 --> 00:00:20,965
A caller reports a cooling problem. The agent checks the service area, offers a real slot, and reads back.

4
00:00:21,372 --> 00:00:27,890
The caller says yes. One token, one write. A retry returns the same booking.

5
00:00:28,437 --> 00:00:36,593
I reproduce your booking failures, separate model from policy, and rank the fixes with a before/after evaluation.

6
00:00:36,996 --> 00:00:41,545
On 40 text scenarios, zero unsafe writes.

7
00:00:41,948 --> 00:00:48,828
Send me two call flows and your worst failure. I'll tell you what's model, policy, or integration.
